Emerald 3DS changes to pret/pokeemerald 76463dac15cad36aca5e2b3f6366abf9e53f814f: Japanese builds draw in the Japanese glyphs
Applies after 0056-follower-pokemon.patch; apply with tools/bootstrap.py.

With GAME_LANGUAGE == LANGUAGE_JAPANESE, text printers and GetStringWidth start in
the Japanese glyph sets (the international code starts in Latin and switches for the
names of Japanese games with EXT_CTRL_CODE_JPN; EXT_CTRL_CODE_ENG still switches to
Latin). The fonts take the Japanese ROM's own metrics and cursor sizes, its glyph
heights (16 rows normal, 12 short), its small-tsu widths in the short font and its
fixed-width first short-font copy. Other languages are unchanged.

